      "name": "Recorded office greeting"
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "IN-L001",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "There's someone by the steps."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L002",
      "speakerId": "ivo",
      "text": "Someone from where?"
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L003",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "I don't know. Get the door."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L010",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "Come up here. Are you hurt?"
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L011",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "Was there anyone with you?"
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L012",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "You can show us from the doorway. Come in first."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L013",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "That happens. I can tell you what we know."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L014",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "All right. You don't have to work it out standing there."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L015",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "Yes. There's water inside."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L020",
      "speakerId": "player",
      "text": "How do I get back?"
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L021",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "Can you show me where you came from?"
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L022",
      "speakerId": "player",
      "text": "I think so."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L023",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "From here. Show me from here."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L024",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "The paths change between places like this. Instruments don't give us a route we can trust."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L025",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "You might get to that fence. You might turn around and find us behind you."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L026",
      "speakerId": "player",
      "text": "And if I don't?"
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L027",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "That's why I'm asking you to stay where you can see the building."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L028",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "You can be all right out there and still not find your way back."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L029",
      "speakerId": "player",
      "text": "Has that happened to someone here?"
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L030",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "People have left. We haven't heard from all of them. That doesn't tell us where they are."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L040",
      "speakerId": "ivo",
      "text": "What should I put down?"
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L041",
      "speakerId": "player",
      "text": "My name."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L042",
      "speakerId": "player",
      "text": "Leave it blank for now."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L043",
      "speakerId": "ivo",
      "text": "All right. We can fill it in later."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L044",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "Do we still have the spare bedding?"
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L045",
      "speakerId": "ivo",
      "text": "Which spare bedding?"
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L046",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "The bedding we keep saying is spare."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L047",
      "speakerId": "player",
      "text": "Does this happen often?"
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L048",
      "speakerId": "ivo",
      "text": "At first, every day. Sometimes several people. It's been a while now."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L049",
      "speakerId": "player",
      "text": "How long since it happened?"
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L050",
      "speakerId": "ivo",
      "text": "A few months. We keep the dates here, but they don't always help with someone who's just arrived."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L060",
      "speakerId": "music-presenter",
      "text": "This one's for the night shift at Orchard. Your request finally reached us."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L061",
      "speakerId": "news-reader",
      "text": "South Relay reports that their upper tanks are working again. We haven't heard directly from the households downstream."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L062",
      "speakerId": "repair-operator",
      "text": "I didn't say cut it. I said disconnect it."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L063",
      "speakerId": "second-repair-operator",
      "text": "Well, it's disconnected."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L064",
      "speakerId": "orchard-operator",
      "text": "Is Ren there? Tell them the recording was terrible. I'm sending it back."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L065",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "They asked for something cheerful."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L066",
      "speakerId": "orchard-operator",
      "text": "And who's new? I can hear you finding another chair."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L067",
      "speakerId": "ivo",
      "text": "We've had an arrival. We'll check in later."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L068",
      "speakerId": "player",
      "text": "Where are they?"
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L069",
      "speakerId": "ivo",
      "text": "They call their place Orchard."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L070",
      "speakerId": "player",
      "text": "How far away?"
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L071",
      "speakerId": "ivo",
      "text": "We don't know."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L072",
      "speakerId": "ivo",
      "text": "Some stations speak for whole districts. Some are one person in a house. Radio is how we reach each other."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L080",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "That mug leaks. Take the other one."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L081",
      "speakerId": "ivo",
      "text": "We can put the bedding in the archive for tonight."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L082",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "There's room. We'll move the boxes."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L083",
      "speakerId": "ivo",
      "text": "Let's check before we promise them a room."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L084",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "Somewhere to sleep, then."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L085",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "You don't have to decide anything tonight."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L086",
      "speakerId": "player",
      "text": "Decide what?"
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L087",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "Whether you're staying."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L088",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "We'll show you where things are."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L089",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "I understand. We can talk about it tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L090",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "All right. The food will be here."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L100",
      "speakerId": "office-recording",
      "text": "Thank you for calling. Our office is currently closed. Please call again during normal business hours."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L101",
      "speakerId": "office-recording",
      "text": "This is the local service office."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L102",
      "speakerId": "ivo",
      "text": "That was our greeting."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L103",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "Do you know where it came from?"
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L104",
      "speakerId": "ivo",
      "text": "No sender I can identify. I'll keep it in the log."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L105",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "Has it happened before?"
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L106",
      "speakerId": "ivo",
      "text": "I've heard that recording before. Coming through like this? No."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L110",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "Eat first. Tomorrow I can show you the desk."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L111",
      "speakerId": "player",
      "text": "I'd like that."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L112",
      "speakerId": "player",
      "text": "I'll think about it."
    },
    {
      "id": "IN-L113",
      "speakerId": "ren",
      "text": "All right. Get some rest."
    }
  ],
